            "description": "## Login\n\nAuthenticates a user and returns an access token upon successful login.\n\n### Request Body\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `email` | string | Yes | The registered email address of the user. |\n| `password` | string | Yes | The user's account password. |\n\n### Example Request Body\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"email\": \"medhat@gmail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}\n\n ```\n\n### Responses\n\n| Status | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| `200 OK` | Login successful. Returns an authentication token. |\n| `401 Unauthorized` | Invalid email or password. |\n| `422 Unprocessable Entity` | Validation error — missing or malformed fields. |"
          },
          "response": []
        },
