            "description": "## Register\n\nCreates a new user account in the system.\n\n### Request Body\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `name` | string | Yes | The full name of the user. |\n| `email` | string | Yes | A unique, valid email address for the account. |\n| `password` | string | Yes | The desired account password. |\n| `role` | string | Yes | The role assigned to the user (e.g. `investor`). |\n\n### Example Request Body\n\n```json\n{\n  \"name\": \"medhat\",\n  \"email\": \"medhat@gmail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\",\n  \"role\": \"investor\"\n}\n```\n\n### Responses\n\n| Status | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `201 Created` | Account created successfully. |\n| `409 Conflict` | An account with the provided email already exists. |\n| `422 Unprocessable Entity` | Validation error — missing or malformed fields. |"
          },
          "response": []
