            "description": "## Forgot Password\n\nInitiates the password reset flow by sending a password reset link to the provided email address.\n\n### Request Body\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `email` | string | Yes | The email address associated with the user's account. |\n\n### Example Request Body\n\n```json\n{\n  \"email\": \"hanaeid136@gmail.com\"\n}\n```\n\n### Responses\n\n| Status | Description |\n|--------|-------------|\n| `200 OK` | Reset link sent successfully to the provided email. |\n| `404 Not Found` | No account found with the provided email address. |\n| `422 Unprocessable Entity` | Validation error — missing or malformed email field. |"
          },
          "response": []
