            "description": "## Reset Password\n\nResets the user's password using a valid reset token. The token is typically obtained from the reset link sent via the Forgot Password endpoint.\n\n### Request Body\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `token` | string | Yes | The password reset token received via email. Can be referenced using the `{{json_web_token_02yn}}` variable. |\n| `password` | string | Yes | The new password to set for the account. |\n\n### Example Request Body\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"token\": \"{{json_web_token_02yn}}\",\n  \"password\": \"newpasswordd\"\n}\n\n ```\n\n### Responses\n\n| Status | Description |\n| --- | --- |\n| `200 OK` | Password reset successfully. |\n| `400 Bad Request` | Invalid or expired reset token. |\n| `422 Unprocessable Entity` | Validation error — missing or malformed fields. |"
          },
          "response": []
