              "host": [
                "localhost"
              ],
              "path": [
                "growzy",
                "routes",
                "api.php",
                "session",
                "1"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Reschedules an existing session by its ID.\n\n**Method:** PUT  \n**Endpoint:** `/session/{id}`\n\n### Path Parameters\n| Parameter | Type | Description |\n|-----------|------|-------------|\n| `id` | integer | The unique ID of the session to reschedule. |\n\n### Request Headers\n| Header | Value | Description |\n|--------|-------|-------------|\n| `Authorization` | `Bearer <token>` | A valid JWT bearer token for the authenticated user. |\n\n### Request Body\nProvide a JSON object with the new date and time for the session.\n\n```json\n{\n    \"dateTime\": \"2026-08-20 15:00:00\"\n}\n```\n\n| Field | Type | Required | Description |\n|-------|------|----------|-------------|\n| `dateTime` | string | Yes | The new date and time for the session in `YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM:SS` format. |\n\n### Response\nReturns the updated session details on success, or an error message if the session is not found or the user is not authorized."
          },
          "response": []
        },
