            "description": "StartFragment\n\n# 1\\. Create Request\n\nCreates a new request for a specific idea.\n\n### Endpoint\n\n```\nPOST /requestRoutes.php?ideaId={ideaId}\n\n ```\n\n### Example URL\n\n```\nhttp://localhost/growzy/routes/requestRoutes.php?ideaId=5\n\n ```\n\n### Headers\n\n| Key | Value |\n| --- | --- |\n| Content-Type | application/json |\n\n### Request Body\n\n```\n{\n  \"description\": \"test request\",\n  \"documentation\": \"file.pdf\"\n}\n\n ```\n\n### Success Response\n\n**Status Code:** `201 Created`\n\n```\n{\n  \"message\": \"Request created successfully\"\n}\n\n ```\n\n### Error Responses\n\n**400 Bad Request**\n\n```\n{\n  \"error\": \"Missing required fields\"\n}\n\n ```\n\n**404 Not Found**\n\n```\n{\n  \"error\": \"Idea not found\"\n}\n\n ```\n\nEndFragment"
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "All Requests",
          "request": {
