            "description": "StartFragment\n\n# 2\\. Get All Requests\n\nRetrieves all requests.\n\n### Endpoint\n\n```\nGET /requestRoutes.php\n\n ```\n\n### Example URL\n\n```\nhttp://localhost/growzy/routes/requestRoutes.php\n\n ```\n\n### Headers\n\nNone required.\n\n### Request Body\n\nNone.\n\n### Success Response\n\n**Status Code:** `200 OK`\n\n```\n[\n  {\n    \"requestID\": 1,\n    \"ideaID\": 5,\n    \"description\": \"test request\",\n    \"documentation\": \"file.pdf\",\n    \"status\": \"Pending\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"requestID\": 2,\n    \"ideaID\": 7,\n    \"description\": \"another request\",\n    \"documentation\": \"cv.pdf\",\n    \"status\": \"Approved\"\n  }\n]\n\n ```\n\nEndFragment"
